# M B020 — docs/technology-stack.md (imported by CLAUDE.md)
1 CO DEP-002 m=MN | Use the stack's technology rather than a silent alternative; replacing it is Reserved (DEP-002).
2 CO DEP-003 | Versions resolved at install time through add-dependency, never copied from memory or examples (DEP-003 registry verification).
3 CO DEP-008 m=DC | .NET 10 LTS, C# 14, ASP.NET Core Controllers; preview/RC requires approval (DEP-008).
4 CD DEP-008 m=M k=P st=S c=M | DEP-008 fixes .NET 10 LTS; remainder: the latest stable servicing release is used.
  x: .NET 10 used on its latest stable servicing (patch) release
  s: Staying on an older 10.0.x servicing release while a newer one exists: satisfies DEP-008; M requires the latest servicing release.
5 CO DEP-009 m=DC | EF Core with SQL Server; provider concerns out of Application and Domain (DEP-009).
6 CO DEP-010~ DEP-004~ m=MN c=M | No deprecated/legacy ASP.NET automatic-validation integration without a concrete requirement (FluentValidation as explicit validation, DEP-010; deprecation diligence, DEP-004).
  e: a concrete requirement
7 CO DEP-010 m=DC | FluentValidation (incl. DependencyInjectionExtensions) is the standard explicit validation library (DEP-010).
8 CO DEP-001~ m=M c=M | Serilog sinks added only when required (DEP-001 concrete need).
9 CO DEP-010 m=DC | Application code logs through ILogger<T>; Serilog (Serilog.AspNetCore) is the provider (DEP-010).
10 CO DEP-001~ c=M | Sinks only when required; a Console sink suffices for local Development (DEP-001).
11 CO API-017 DEP-012~ m=D | Swagger UI outside Development only when requirements justify it (API-017).
12 CO DEP-012 m=DC | Swashbuckle Swagger UI is the default Development documentation/testing surface; built-in AddOpenApi/MapOpenApi is not the default (DEP-012).
13 CO DEP-013 m=DC | NUnit; Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Testing with WebApplicationFactory<Program>; test projects under backend/ (DEP-013).
14 CO DEP-013~ TST-007~ m=DC | Testcontainers only when isolated real-provider tests justify it (DEP-013 conditional).
15 CO DEP-022 m=D | .slnx by default; .sln only when required (DEP-022).
16 CO DEP-023 m=D | Repository-level Directory.Build.props and Directory.Packages.props; project-specific settings in their projects (DEP-023).
17 CO DEP-014 m=DC | Angular baseline (latest stable with current CLI, compatible TypeScript/RxJS, standalone, strict, routing, zoneless when supported, SCSS, Material/CDK, Vitest) (DEP-014).
18 CO DEP-015 m=MN | No NgRx/Axios/Lodash/Bootstrap/Tailwind/extra libraries by default (DEP-015).
19 CO DEP-011 DEP-002~ m=D | Manual mapping for simple cases, Mapster when volume warrants, no other mapping framework without approval (DEP-011, DEP-002).
20 CO DEP-001 DEP-011~ | Conditional technologies approved but added only when needed (DEP-001, DEP-011).
21 CO DEP-011~ m=D | Conditional technologies added only when their capability is needed (DEP-011).
22 CO DEP-002~ DEP-011~ ARC-002~ m=MN | No other mapping framework without approval; mapping-library concerns out of Domain.
23 CO DEP-011 m=D | Manual mapping fine for simple cases; Mapster approved when volume warrants (DEP-011).
24 CO DEP-011 m=D | Microsoft resilience packages approved only when a real integration needs resilience (DEP-011).
25 CO DEP-013~ TST-007~ m=D | Testcontainers conditional on justified isolated real-provider tests.
26 CO DEP-016 m=D | Playwright approved default for required frontend E2E, not in the minimal scaffold (DEP-016).
27 CO DEP-018 m=MN | No Docker merely because the app can be containerized (DEP-018).
